resses from Anqing. Huangmei opera is a significant cultural treasure that defines the rich heritage of the city of Anqing.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/%E6%8C%AF%E9%A3%8E%E5%A1%94%E5%B7%A6%E6%9C%9B_-_Look_Left_from_Zhenfeng_Pagoda_-_2010.07.jpg/330px-%E6%8C%AF%E9%A3%8E%E5%A1%94%E5%B7%A6%E6%9C%9B_-_Look_Left_from_Zhenfeng_Pagoda_-_2010.07.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anqing"},"twins":["Q502403","Q188894"],"climate":{"temp":[3.6,6.4,11.3,17.2,22.1,25.7,28.5,27.8,23.7,18.2,12,5.2],"rain":[68,95,125,169,193,266,277,180,101,70,79,51],"cloud":[67,72,71,72,75,80,74,68,64,60,57,58]}}